# Every file is stored and checked out with LF, on every platform.
#
# Not cosmetic: native/PROVENANCE-FILES.tsv records the SHA-256 of each copied
# file as it is in the SWARM wallet, whose own .gitattributes says the same thing.
# A CRLF checkout on Windows would change every one of those hashes and make
# scripts/check-provenance.mjs fail on a tree that is in fact correct.
* text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.node binary
